// The fingerprint HAL is now provided by the shared
// android.hardware.biometrics.fingerprint@2.3-service.oplus from hardware/oplus,
// and UDFPS by //hardware/oplus:libudfps_extension.oplus (wired via
// soong_config_set surfaceflinger udfps_lib in device.mk). The vendor
// vendor.oplus.hardware.biometrics.fingerprint@2.1 interface also comes from
// hardware/oplus now. The old inline service.cpp / BiometricsFingerprint* /
// UdfpsExtension here are retained for reference only and are not built
// (their modules previously collided with the hardware/oplus equivalents).
